INSERT INTO "grid_transformation" VALUES('EPSG','8372','RGF93 v2 to NGF-IGN78 height (2)','Replaces ggf97a model (code 10002)]. Replaced by RAC23 model (code 10506). Accuracy at each grid node is given in the geoid model file. For reversible alternative see RGF93 v2 to RGF93 v2 + NGF-IGN78 height (2) (code 9639).','EPSG','1073','Geographic3D to GravityRelatedHeight (IGN2009)','EPSG','9776','EPSG','5721',0.05,'EPSG','8666','Geoid (height correction) model file','RAC09.mnt',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'IGN Fra Cor 09',0);
